{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Consent","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Consent.swift#L42","fileName":"Consent.swift"}},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The app makes one where it starts, from the decisions it saved, gives it to its tracker, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"updates it as the user decides:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let consent = Consent([.analytics: .granted])","let tracker = Tracker(consent: consent)","\/\/ Later, from the consent prompt:","consent.grant(.advertising)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each event is gated by its type’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event.consentCategory"},{"type":"text","text":", by the decisions made before it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Granted:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" delivered as any event is, written to the tracker’s store first if it has one."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Undecided:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" held in memory, and not written to the store, until the category is decided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Granting it delivers its held events in the order they were tracked, before any event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked after the grant; denying it drops them, reported on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". The hold keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at most "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"heldRecordLimit"},{"type":"text","text":" events across every category and tracker: when it is full, its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"oldest is dropped to make room, reported as it happens (merged with the overflow reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not yet read). Held events are lost if the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends first."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Denied:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" dropped, and not collected at all, so not reported."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records a store recovered from an earlier run are gated again as the tracker starts, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consent may have changed since. One whose category is now denied is dropped, reported and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forgotten by the store. One whose category is undecided is held outside the bound, still kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the store, so a full hold never drops it; if the app ends first, it is gated again on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next launch. One the store drops for its own byte bound while held is reported by the store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and still delivered if granted in this run, as a record a delivery has already read is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A category not given a status is undecided. Withdrawing consent is a denial: records the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker had already let through when it was granted are still delivered.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Copies share one set of decisions and one hold. A decision returns at once, from any thread:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it records the status, which "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns from then on, and queues the decision"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for each tracker given the consent, whose own worker releases or drops what it held. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker reports its own drops."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent"]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:checkedHeldRecordLimit:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/heldRecordCount"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/deny(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/grant(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)"]},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/defaultHeldRecordLimit"]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/init(_:checkedHeldRecordLimit:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/init(_:checkedheldrecordlimit:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A consent with the categories in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"statuses"},{"type":"text","text":" decided, and every other undecided, holding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at most "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"checkedHeldRecordLimit"},{"type":"text","text":" records while undecided."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:checkedHeldRecordLimit:)","title":"init(_:checkedHeldRecordLimit:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConsentCategory","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConsentStatus","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers13ConsentStatusO"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"checkedHeldRecordLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NegativeHeldRecordLimit","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers23NegativeHeldRecordLimitV"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"Trackers","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","url":"\/documentation\/trackers"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/dropReports":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports","title":"dropReports"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/defaultHeldRecordLimit":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The most records a consent holds unless it is given another bound: 1,000."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/defaultHeldRecordLimit","title":"defaultHeldRecordLimit","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/defaultheldrecordlimit","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultHeldRecordLimit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/heldRecordCount":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/heldrecordcount","abstract":[{"text":"How many records are held, waiting for their category to be decided: those held in memory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only and those a store recovered.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"heldRecordCount"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"}],"role":"symbol","title":"heldRecordCount","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/heldRecordCount"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A consent with the categories in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"statuses"},{"type":"text","text":" decided, and every other undecided."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV","text":"ConsentCategory","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers13ConsentStatusO","text":"ConsentStatus","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"heldRecordLimit","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"init(_:heldRecordLimit:)","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/init(_:heldrecordlimit:)"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/deny(_:)":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deny","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentCategory","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV"},{"text":"...)","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Denies "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"categories"},{"type":"text","text":": their held events are dropped, reported on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ones are not collected."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/deny(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/deny(_:)","title":"deny(_:)"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/status(of:)":{"title":"status(of:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The status of "},{"code":"category","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": undecided unless given or decided."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"status","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentCategory","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentStatus","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers13ConsentStatusO","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/status(of:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)"},"doc://Trackers/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent","type":"topic","title":"Consent","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/grant(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"grant(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Grants "},{"code":"categories","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": their held events are delivered, oldest first, and later ones as they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are tracked."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"grant","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentCategory","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"...)","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/grant(_:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/grant(_:)"},"doc://Trackers/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP"}}}